DSH Workbench

This extension integrates DeepSeek Harness through its native plugin, Session and Agent Teams APIs. DeepSeek Harness is an MIT-licensed dependency; its copyright and license are distributed with the installed @deepseek-ai/dsh package.
https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness

The task/source/outbox design is informed by the MIT-licensed dsh-superagent research prototype. This extension does not distribute a modified DSH core and does not require its GitHub or Feishu integrations.
https://github.com/deepseek-ai/dsh-superagent-prototype

No Hermes IM adapter code is included in this dashboard release.
